  "bio": "Frank Pignat is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in the intricacies of black and gray tattoos. Working out of Lucerne, Switzerland, Frank is known for his incredible attention to detail and the stunning depth he brings to his monochromatic designs. You can find a glimpse of his impressive portfolio under the handle @hotflashtattoos, where his professionalism and artistic prowess are on full display.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lucerne, Lucerne, Switzerland\n\nWorking @hotflashtattoos, Luzern, Switzerland.    DM for bookings",
